cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Persona Prompt Corpus"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it using these metadata."
type: dataset
version: "1.1.0"
abstract: >-
  A dataset of 281 AI agent persona prompts collected from public GitHub
  repositories. Every record is pinned to a repository, path, and commit SHA.
  Source text is bundled for the 179 records where redistribution is permitted.
  Version 1.1 adds two raters' independent labels for every record (nine content
  facets, a count of conditional clauses, and an ordinal form scale), the
  disagreement list, the annotation guide, and the scripts that reproduce the
  agreement and label statistics.
authors:
